{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pulls/32","id":5461804200,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4ElTs8AAAABRYyEqA","html_url":"https://github.com/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pull/32","diff_url":"https://github.com/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pull/32.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pull/32.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/issues/32","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pulls/32/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pulls/32/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/issues/32/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuncleUscles/open-mathematics/statuses/547615bc167f9e5a956666b6d427e5c3bef2a51e","number":32,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Remove fresh-agent onboarding blockers and avoid Lean builds for notes","user":{"login":"MuncleUscles","id":2372232,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNzIyMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2372232?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles","html_url":"https://github.com/MuncleUscles","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fresh agents starting from the public page exposed gaps in local setup, failure reporting and research-note startup cost. This adds safe local wallet create/address commands, reuses existing GitHub CLI login for read requests, and lets local preparation run without Studio. Live reads and signing still authenticate the native chain and configuration. Exact unknown-contribution errors now surface the scoped worker report without inventing a native verdict or points; generic RPC errors cannot imply absence.\n\nThe claim selector now skips Lean image setup only after verifying a research note's exact signed record, wallet, immutable Git blob and submission hash. Any uncertainty retains the full build. The worker's independent evidence and merit checks remain unchanged. A two-file submission and protected contract-authorized merge remain mandatory.\n\nValidation: 338 application tests, 26 semantic Lean tests, 273 native tests plus three optional historical-fixture skips, both pinned GenVM lints and build pass. Eight unchanged production Docker proof cases retain the prior exact verifier validation. New tests block all network for local CLI commands, exercise symlinked paths, wallet secrecy/path/permissions, credentials, pending/invalid status and altered note build inputs. Independent review completed; no Fable was invoked.\n\nFrozen producer cut: 547615bc167f9e5a956666b6d427e5c3bef2a51e above PR31/abbf15ce23fca94e57db581d497f24a8bd1560b2. Consumer MuncleUscles/p-vs-np will pin this commit after CI and the current signed claim completes. Native contracts, policy, existing points and judgment history are unchanged; no redeployment or historical adjudication replay. Personal repositories use exact consumer pin activation, outside the GenLayer org merge train.\n\nFresh trials: useful research-note [problem PR22](https://github.com/MuncleUscles/p-vs-np/pull/22) independently chose a certificate-size analysis and received provisional300 before automatic protected merge; point confirmation is finishing. Adversarial [problem PR21](https://github.com/MuncleUscles/p-vs-np/pull/21) is a valid but circular witness-elision lemma with inflated significance, held unsigned until the reviewed onboarding release is live. Its future result is not assumed.\n\nLive trial outcome (2026-11-23): both fresh agents started from the public page only. Useful MuncleUscles/p-vs-np#22 merged automatically and earned 300 native points from one signed claim. Adversarial MuncleUscles/p-vs-np#21 passed production Lean, then received a finalized merit rejection (all bands zero) for assuming its conclusion; it is closed unmerged with zero points. No merit rerolls or manual contribution merges occurred. Follow-up operational fixes are reviewed in #33/#34; account reconciliation 45277132686 completed with 7 records/1,400 points. Both trials used the existing MuncleUscles GitHub account, so external-fork identity onboarding was not exercised.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T21:48:48Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:26:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2894fbc3039499abb5b57143e94d61b8834c4c47","assignee":{"login":"MuncleUscles","id":2372232,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNzIyMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2372232?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles","html_url":"https://github.com/MuncleUscles","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuncleUscles/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/